# HubSpot Association Page / paging Value

Exact structural field contract extracted from HubSpot Association Page. Optional presence belongs to the containing node socket; null is accepted only when this schema explicitly allows it. Required object fields and list element schemas are checked at runtime. Extension values use the explicit recursive ONFJsonValue vocabulary. This type has pure JSON Encode/Decode codecs.

## Audited socket contract (21 October 2026)

Inputs:
No data sockets.

Outputs:
No data sockets.

Configuration:
No asset-specific configuration.

